Rx0Ka34w&oe=6B0055C9"}, {"file_name": "New Project (4).png", "id": "1793762854583913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820019_1793762857917246_35344171708235581_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsxT5f_l1vgQ7kNvwG9R6T4&_nc_oc=AdqdumTrbEosV_Eka9-rxpsPHuHlKBDVQlXqAAZu-bz1KNsGKI6OM8LIFIe8Sy24MdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSeEZq3N7Ftl1WXpCLU5RvJ2sWgMjbRDl5qXORZTAcr_w&oe=6B005A29"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FROZEN IN FEAR : Don't Blink (Demo)", "keywords": ["frozen", "fear", "horror", "scary", "mannequins"], "long_description": "**Frozen In Fear VR: Don\u2019t Blink \u2013 Demo** \n\nGet a taste of the terror. \n\nStep into the world of Frozen in Fear VR and experience a chilling slice of its heart-pounding gameplay. In this demo, you\u2019ll face the same relentless mannequins, statues, and possessed figures that move only when you\u2019re not looking\u2026 and they\u2019re closer than ever. \n**What\u2019s in the Demo**: \n- A simplified level featuring the iconic mannequins, where your goal is to collect as many artifacts as possible before they catch you.\n - A sample of the randomised scares and tense atmosphere from the full game. \n\n**Upgrade to Full Game for:** \n- More fleshed out levels and enemies, multiplayer with up too 3 friends, and extra items. \n- More story gameplay, with real objectives to complete.\n- Frequent updates and terrifying twists based on player feedback. \n\nThis is just the beginning. The mannequins are waiting \u2014 are you brave enough to play the full game?", "short_description": "Don't blink - they're watching.\n\nIn this a demo for the multiplayer VR horror, mannequins only move when you can't see them. Search for clues, escape the map, and survive with up to 3 friends... but whatever you do, don't look away.\n\nAvailable on Meta Quest 3 & 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "d